  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>G Warstaff — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>With your mastery over Reverse Cursed Technique comes your cursed technique reversal. Just like when using G Warstaff normally, you fulfill G Warstaff's condition for ink by hitting a creature. However, instead of being able to see their future, you can see their past. As a bonus action for 2 cursed energy, you can view their manga panel and learn the general actions they took over the past few weeks. You can see a number of weeks in the past equal to the amount of seconds marked by G Warstaff.</p>",
